      "chunk_id": "gaja_overview",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "character_identity",
      "title": "Gaja Overview: The Baby Elephant & Heavyweight Stomp",
      "text": "Character: Gaja (gaja). Title: The Baby Elephant & Heavyweight Stomp. Cultural Motif: Airavata / Gajendra (Sacred Indian Elephant). Significance: Emblem of wisdom, steadfast strength, and unbreakable memory. Represents patience and immense physical weight. Height: 1.25m. Superpower: Heavyweight Anchor (Invariance): When swapped, smaller elements must hop completely over Gaja. Gaja's high numeric values bubble steadily rightward pass-by-pass into the sorted partition. Jump physics: Heavyweight Stomp: Deep crouch with delayed lift; lands with an earth-shaking resonant thud. Ears flap wide and trunk curls upward in triumphant J-salute."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "gaja_culture",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "cultural_heritage",
      "title": "Gaja Cultural Heritage & Motif",
      "text": "Gaja (gaja) is inspired by Airavata / Gajendra (Sacred Indian Elephant). Significance: Emblem of wisdom, steadfast strength, and unbreakable memory. Represents patience and immense physical weight. This character connects authentic Indian heritage and biodiversity with computer science education."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "gaja_algorithm",
      "character_id": "gaja",
      "category": "bubble_sort_pedagogy",
      "title": "Gaja Bubble Sort Superpower & Jump Mechanics",
      "text": "In Bubble Sort, Gaja (gaja) wields the superpower: 'Heavyweight Anchor (Invariance): When swapped, smaller elements must hop completely over Gaja. Gaja's high numeric values bubble steadily rightward pass-by-pass into the sorted partition.'. Unique Jump Physics: Heavyweight Stomp: Deep crouch with delayed lift; lands with an earth-shaking resonant thud. Ears flap wide and trunk curls upward in triumphant J-salute. Height in simulation: 1.25 meters."
    },
