    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "diya_overview",
      "character_id": "diya",
      "category": "character_identity",
      "title": "Diya Overview: The Terracotta Lamp & Flame Burst",
      "text": "Character: Diya (diya). Title: The Terracotta Lamp & Flame Burst. Cultural Motif: Deepa / Diya (Clay Sacred Oil Lamp). Significance: Triumph of knowledge over ignorance (Tamaso ma jyotir gamaya). Inner truth, persistence, and continuous illumination. Height: 0.85m. Superpower: Traversal Illuminator (Active Comparison): Flame flares into brilliant white-gold when inspecting adjacent pairs; cheek ember pulses warm amber when an inversion is detected. Jump physics: Flame Burst Leap: Rapid, high-frequency spring; its living sculpted S-curve flame stretches and trails warm golden light in the air."
    },
