    {
      "chunk_id": "kumbha_overview",
      "character_id": "kumbha",
      "category": "character_identity",
      "title": "Kumbha Overview: The Sacred Kalasha & Boundary Chime",
      "text": "Character: Kumbha (kumbha). Title: The Sacred Kalasha & Boundary Chime. Cultural Motif: Purna Kalasha / Kumbha (Auspicious Vessel). Significance: Emblem of fullness, auspicious abundance, and source of life. Adorned with mango leaves (Amrapallava) and sacred coconut (Shriphala). Height: 0.98m. Superpower: Partition Boundary Buffer (Completion): Marks the sorted partition boundary (n - i - 1). Emits a golden sacred chime when an element reaches its permanent invariant slot. Jump physics: Resonant Bell Chime Hop: Solid, balanced metallic leap; the 5 pointed mango leaves flutter rhythmically and coconut tuft sways, landing with a clean temple chime."
